# X+ Language — GitHub Linguist setup
#
# GitHub can't display a fully custom language name ("X+") in the
# Languages bar until the language is added to github/linguist.
# Until then, .xp sources are counted and highlighted as the
# implementation language, and compiler-generated asm is hidden
# from stats and diffs.

*.xp text linguist-language=Python
*.asm linguist-generated
*.bin -text
*.img -text
